# {{ project_name }}

A Litestar application scaffolded with [bootpy](https://pypi.org/project/bootpy-cli/).

## Quick Start

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
litestar --app app run
```

